<title>LATVIA: RIETUMU, LAND SECURITIES LICENCE RE-REGISTERED.</title>
<headline>RIETUMU, LAND SECURITIES LICENCE RE-REGISTERED.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The securities commission on Wednesday said that it re-registered the securities licences of banks Rietumu Bank and Banka Land.</p>
<p>The commission said in a statement that both licences were re-registered and were valid to May 1 1998.</p>
<p>It also said that it re-registered the Latgale Finance and Investment Company for three months.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
